            <description><![CDATA[<html><body>
<p><b>Ask Claude is switched off for now</b></p>
<ul>
<li>The <b>Ask Claude</b> button is gone from presentations, along with its window and the API-key field. The app never contacts Anthropic. Ask Claude may come back in a later Pro version.</li>
<li>New presentations now say &quot;Click a box to type.&quot;</li>
<li>The &quot;Draft on this Mac (Apple AI)&quot; option lived in the same window, so it is gone too for now.</li>
<li>Presentations saved to the Claude Inbox folder are no longer picked up by themselves. Double-clicking a .tsdeck file still opens it as a presentation.</li>
</ul>
<p><b>Explore App Features</b></p>
<ul>
<li>The guide now points to <b>Account</b> (not Settings) for Restore purchases, Manage subscription and Delete account, in every language.</li>
</ul>
</body></html>
]]></description>
